WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Assign a responsible store reviewer
Change reviewer or due date is a separate recorded action. Select
eligible staff from the owning store and explain the change. An
untouched deadline keeps its exact timestamp; a partial date/time cannot
submit.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Read who decided and why
Case history retains replies, warning, resolution, appeal, assignment
and dismissal. Names identify resolved actors; earlier events remain
immutable. A recorded warning is not an automatic financial penalty.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Check the owning store and missing evidence
The store filter applies to case lists, summaries and work queues. This
required-evidence row identifies the store, vendor and missing document
type without exposing a private file. Investigate before deciding.
